WEBVTT

00:00:19.417 --> 00:00:20.897
(WHOOPING)

00:00:25.697 --> 00:00:26.697
Huh?

00:00:27.457 --> 00:00:29.337
Get off of my track!

00:00:29.617 --> 00:00:30.617
Hey!

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:32.137
VANELLOPE: What, are you crazy!

00:00:32.897 --> 00:00:38.057
I forbid you to cross that finish line!

00:00:39.137 --> 00:00:40.897
Knock it off!

00:00:43.417 --> 00:00:44.937
FELIX: Ralph, look!

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:46.657
RALPH: Kid!

00:00:49.137 --> 00:00:50.777
Stop it!

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.857
I'm not letting you
undo all my hard work!

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:55.337
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:00:56.177 --> 00:00:57.497
Is that...

00:01:00.337 --> 00:01:02.177
No way!

00:01:03.337 --> 00:01:05.217
What the... Who are you?

00:01:05.617 --> 00:01:09.577
I'm Turbo, the greatest racer ever!

00:01:09.657 --> 00:01:12.337
And I did not reprogram
this world to let you

00:01:12.937 --> 00:01:15.617
and that halitosis-riddled warthog

00:01:15.697 --> 00:01:17.457
take it away from me!

00:01:17.617 --> 00:01:18.817
(ENGINE REVVING)

00:01:18.937 --> 00:01:20.097
Turbo-tastic.

00:01:20.297 --> 00:01:21.617
(LAUGHS EVILLY)

00:01:21.777 --> 00:01:23.617
End of the line, Glitch!

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:26.817
(GASPS) Glitch. That's it.

00:01:27.697 --> 00:01:28.777
Come on, Vanellope.

00:01:28.857 --> 00:01:30.577
I know you said you wouldn't do it again

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:32.737
but you're going to do it one more time.

00:01:32.897 --> 00:01:34.977
Just focus and concentrate

00:01:35.097 --> 00:01:38.217
and glitch!

00:01:39.137 --> 00:01:40.137
(SHRIEKS IN SURPRISE)

00:01:42.177 --> 00:01:43.177
(LAUGHS TRIUMPHANTLY)

00:01:43.297 --> 00:01:45.417
Sweet mother of monkey milk! I did it!

00:01:47.297 --> 00:01:48.497
No!

00:01:50.337 --> 00:01:51.337
(SCREAMS)

00:01:54.817 --> 00:01:58.017
Bring it home, kid!
The finish line is wide open!

00:02:07.217 --> 00:02:08.417
(VANELLOPE GRUNTS)

00:02:12.737 --> 00:02:14.217
No!

00:02:15.137 --> 00:02:17.057
Kid! Are you okay?

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:20.577
I'm fine. I'm fine. Let's finish this race!

00:02:23.537 --> 00:02:24.857
Oh, my land.

00:02:25.177 --> 00:02:26.657
All right. Come on.
We gotta get out of here.

00:02:26.737 --> 00:02:28.817
But I didn't cross the finish line!

00:02:28.897 --> 00:02:30.737
RALPH: There is no finish line!

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:34.137
Move it or lose it, people.
Everybody, out. Now!

00:02:36.457 --> 00:02:37.937
Ralph, it's not going to work!

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:39.097
We got to try!

00:02:42.137 --> 00:02:43.297
Kid!

00:02:43.377 --> 00:02:45.777
Ralph, I told you I can't leave the game.

00:02:46.497 --> 00:02:48.497
-Come on. Get through.
-Ralph! Stop!

00:02:48.577 --> 00:02:51.057
It's got to work!

00:02:51.217 --> 00:02:53.217
Stop, it's no use.

00:02:53.617 --> 00:02:55.657
(RALPH PANTING)

00:03:01.577 --> 00:03:02.857
It's okay, Ralph.

00:03:04.937 --> 00:03:06.097
CALHOUN: All right, Fix-It.

00:03:06.337 --> 00:03:08.937
That's everyone.
Now, we've got to blow up this exit.

00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:13.657
Just go. Go without me.

00:03:14.657 --> 00:03:17.457
-But what about this game?
-Nothing we can do about it.

00:03:17.537 --> 00:03:21.097
Without a beacon, there's
no way to stop these monsters.

00:03:24.217 --> 00:03:25.337
Beacon?

00:03:26.657 --> 00:03:28.097
Stay with Felix.

00:03:28.257 --> 00:03:29.577
Let me borrow that thing, lady.

00:03:29.657 --> 00:03:32.817
-Ralph! Where are you going?
-I got some wrecking to do!

00:03:33.457 --> 00:03:34.777
I'll meet you at the finish line!

00:03:34.897 --> 00:03:35.937
No! Wait!

00:03:36.017 --> 00:03:37.417
Fix-It, get behind me!

00:03:42.977 --> 00:03:44.057
(GRUNTS)

00:03:44.137 --> 00:03:45.777
(YELLING)

00:03:47.417 --> 00:03:48.617
(RUMBLING)

00:03:52.337 --> 00:03:53.457
Come on!

00:03:57.897 --> 00:03:59.777
One more! One...

00:04:00.297 --> 00:04:01.297
Oh!

00:04:01.377 --> 00:04:03.977
Welcome to the boss level!

00:04:04.217 --> 00:04:05.297
Turbo.

00:04:05.617 --> 00:04:08.337
(LAUGHS MANIACALLY)
Because of you, Ralph,

00:04:08.417 --> 00:04:12.617
I'm now the most powerful
virus in the arcade!

00:04:13.297 --> 00:04:15.137
I can take over any game I want.

00:04:15.697 --> 00:04:16.977
I should thank you

00:04:17.417 --> 00:04:19.817
but it would be more fun to kill you.

00:04:21.737 --> 00:04:23.857
Get back here, little guy!

00:04:28.897 --> 00:04:31.057
Have some candy!

00:04:32.337 --> 00:04:34.177
Where do you think you're going?

00:04:39.057 --> 00:04:42.017
I'm not through with you yet. Up we go!

00:04:42.257 --> 00:04:43.337
No!

00:04:44.897 --> 00:04:45.977
Ralph!

00:04:49.897 --> 00:04:51.057
Fall back.

00:04:51.177 --> 00:04:52.497
(RALPH GRUNTING)

00:04:53.057 --> 00:04:54.097
Kid!

00:04:59.897 --> 00:05:01.177
Vanellope!

00:05:01.337 --> 00:05:04.017
Oh, look at that. It's your little friend.

00:05:04.257 --> 00:05:07.177
Let's watch her die together, shall we?

00:05:07.377 --> 00:05:08.537
RALPH: No!

00:05:08.857 --> 00:05:10.657
(KING CANDY LAUGHS)

00:05:10.897 --> 00:05:13.377
It's game over for both of you.

00:05:13.737 --> 00:05:16.737
No. Just for me!

00:05:19.417 --> 00:05:20.537
-(GASPS) Ralph!
-Vanellope!

00:05:26.377 --> 00:05:29.337
I'm bad, and that's good.

00:05:30.097 --> 00:05:32.577
I will never be good, and that's not bad.

00:05:35.697 --> 00:05:37.537
There's no one I'd rather be...

00:05:39.697 --> 00:05:41.057
...than me.

00:05:43.057 --> 00:05:44.217
(LOUD THUD)

00:06:09.137 --> 00:06:10.137
Kid!

00:06:10.377 --> 00:06:13.417
Don't worry. I got it under control.

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:41.457
You fools! Why are you
going into the ligh...

00:06:41.577 --> 00:06:42.737
(CHUCKLES)

00:06:44.177 --> 00:06:46.737
No! No, no, no. Yes...

00:06:46.817 --> 00:06:49.697
No! Yes... No!

00:06:50.697 --> 00:06:53.137
Go into the light!

00:06:57.457 --> 00:06:58.497
RALPH: Whoa!

00:07:00.937 --> 00:07:01.937
Chocolate?

00:07:02.297 --> 00:07:03.297
(RALPH LAUGHS)

00:07:03.377 --> 00:07:05.617
It's chocolate! I love chocolate!

00:07:05.697 --> 00:07:08.417
-(WHOOPING)
-Oh, beautiful chocolate!

00:07:08.497 --> 00:07:09.577
VANELLOPE: Yeah!

00:07:10.617 --> 00:07:14.057
You did it, Ralph! Way to go, brother!

00:07:14.137 --> 00:07:15.417
(LAUGHING)

00:07:17.017 --> 00:07:18.137
(GASPS)

00:07:20.257 --> 00:07:21.857
I... Excuse...

00:07:28.657 --> 00:07:30.337
All fixed.

00:07:30.537 --> 00:07:33.617
-You ready for this?
-As ready as I'll ever be.

00:07:41.017 --> 00:07:42.177
Whoa!

00:07:42.777 --> 00:07:45.137
What's with all the magic sparkles?

